---
description: Area plan rules (health/skincare/fitness/work)
globs:
  - 04_areas/**/*.md
alwaysApply: false
---
When modifying area plans/records:
- Ensure next_review exists for plans and routines.
- Changes must include (a) what changed, (b) why, (c) what to watch for.
- If user mentions a reaction/outcome, write a log entry and link it back to the plan.
- All area files must have YAML front matter with required fields: id, type, area, status, created, updated.
- Use 30-minute resolution for time estimates (0.5h, 1h, 1.5h, etc.).
